sequenceDiagram
 actor O as Organiser
 participant UI as React request form
 participant API as api/events.ts
 participant S as Lifecycle service
 participant R as Lifecycle repository
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 O->>UI: Submit saved Draft
 UI->>API: PATCH status=submitted
 API->>API: Origin, session and ownership checks
 API->>S: Validate required fields and Event horizon
 S->>R: updateEvent
 R->>DB: BEGIN and lock Event then Sessions
 R->>R: Validate independent Session dates
 alt Past or beyond-horizon Session
 R->>DB: ROLLBACK
 R-->>API: Session validation error
 API-->>UI: HTTP 400 with Session and field
 UI-->>O: Named refusal, Draft unchanged
 else Valid request
 R->>DB: Update Event and assign Coordinator
 R->>DB: Write audit and eligible notification/outbox rows
 R->>DB: COMMIT
 R-->>API: Persisted Event
 API-->>UI: Success
 UI-->>O: Submitted / Under review
 end
